# 🎬 Netflix Clone

A full-stack Netflix clone built with **Next.js**, **React**, **TypeScript**, **MongoDB**, **Tailwind CSS**, and **NextAuth**. Dockerized for easy development and deployment.

---
# please see demo
    https://drive.google.com/file/d/17Xg2EuuwkJET0b-JTSsEqEmX_b9Bsa42/view?usp=drive_link 
## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 Authentication with NextAuth (Credentials, Google, GitHub)
- 🎞 Featured Billboard movie
- 📂 Filter by Genre (Action, Drama, Comedy, Series)
- ⭐ Add/Remove from Favorites ("My List")
- 📱 Fully Responsive UI
- 🔒 Protected Routes
- 💬 Movie Info Modal
- 🐳 Docker support for seamless setup

---

## 🧑‍💻 Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** Next.js, React, TypeScript
- **Backend:** Next.js API Routes
- **Auth:** NextAuth.js (OAuth + Credentials)
- **Database:** MongoDB
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS
- **Containerization:** Docker, Docker Compose

---

## 📂 Folder Structure
netflix-clone/
├── components/         # UI components
├── hooks/              # React hooks
├── pages/              # Next.js pages (routes)
│   ├── api/            # API routes (auth, movies)
├── prisma/             # MongoDB models and DB seed
├── public/             # Static files
├── styles/             # Global styles
├── utils/              # Helper functions
├── docker-compose.yml
├── Dockerfile
└── ...

#Install Dependencies
npm install
npm run dev

